{"path":"string/char_traits/move","title":"std::char_traits<char>::move, std::char_traits<wchar_t>::move, std::char_traits<char8_t>::move, std::char_traits<char16_t>::move, std::char_traits<char32_t>::move","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::char_traits&lt;char&gt;::</span>move, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::char_traits&lt;wchar_t&gt;::</span>move, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::char_traits&lt;char8_t&gt;::</span>move, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::char_traits&lt;char16_t&gt;::</span>move, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::char_traits&lt;char32_t&gt;::</span>move","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/char_traits/move","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Copies count characters from the character string pointed to by src to the character string pointed to by dest.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">static</span> char_type<span class=\"sy2\">*</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; move<span class=\"br0\">(</span> char_type<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> dest, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> char_type<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> src, <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> count <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(constexpr since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Copies <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">count</span></code> characters from the character string pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">src</span></code> to the character string pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code>.\n</p><p>Performs correctly even if the ranges <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">src</span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">src <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> count</span></code><code>)</code></span> and <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> count</span></code><code>)</code></span> overlap.\n</p><p>See <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/CharTraits\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">CharTraits</em></a> for the general requirements on character traits for <code>X::move</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> dest\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to a character string to copy to\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> src\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to a character string to copy from\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> count\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the number of characters to copy\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>Throws nothing.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Linear in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">count</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue7\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 7</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td>the copy was guaranteed to perform correctly if<br><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">src</span></code> is in <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> count</span></code><code>)</code></span>, but not the other<br>way round (i.e. <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code> is in <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">src</span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">src <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> count</span></code><code>)</code></span>)\n</td>\n<td>also guaranteed\n</td></tr></table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/char_traits","title":"std::char_traits"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::char_traits<char>::move, std::char_traits<wchar_t>::move, std::char_traits<char8_t>::move, std::char_traits<char16_t>::move, std::char_traits<char32_t>::move","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Copies count characters from the character string pointed to by src to the character string pointed to by dest."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"dest, src, count"},{"label":"Return value","note":"dest"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"Throws nothing."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Linear in count."}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":154,"codeBlockCount":0}
